      "created_at": "2011-09-11T15:48:22.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi there. I was going to create some health trackers of my own using the characters art, and make them the same size as the cards. I found the hero images an the main site, but only 4 of them didn’t have this big watermark in the middle of them.</p>\n<p>So I guess I’m either asking for images that don’t have the watermark, or I’m telling you there are 4 that need the mark added.</p>\n<p>Thanks.</p>",
